SUMMARY:Brunch at Field and Kitchen
DESCRIPTION:Hendo Fun Friends\nWe will meet at ***Field and Kitchen for Br
 unch.***\nAddress: 1620 Brevard Road\, Hendersonville. On Hwy 64 next to Y
 AM yoga studio.\n**A limit of 12 ppl are welcome to join me.**\n**Please k
 eep your RSVP’s current. (I need to let them know how many we got !)**\n
 We will meet inside\, find our table(s) and order.\nThere is seating insid
 e for 8 ppl. If you’re late you’ll eat standing or at outside picnic t
 ables. 😉\nI’ll have an HFF sign on the table.\n**Description:**\n**Co
 st:** By donation\, suggested only $14 per bowl.\nAll healthy bowls\, load
 s of options. ‘In-Season’ local farm produce. Constantly changing menu
 . They are a non-profit supporting the community. Their Mini-Market sells 
 fresh ‘to-go’ items and artisanal products from local ‘foodpreneurs
 ’ that are made ‘in-house’.\nWebsite(s): https://www.fieldandkitchen
 .org/\nHours: Monday–Friday\; 11:00 am – 2:00 pm
